@startuml
hide footbox
actor Author
participant "Value set" as List
participant AutoKey
participant "Bash picker" as Picker

Author -> List: create docs
note right of List: URL | label
Author -> AutoKey: register ;;docs
note right of AutoKey: abbreviation + Python
Author -> AutoKey: type ;;docs + Space
AutoKey -> Picker: docs, 6
Picker -> List: read docs
Picker --> Author: chosen URL lands in the draft
@enduml
